@RequestsManagement.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5114

### First page, default sort (createdAt desc)
GET {{RequestsManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Accept: application/json

### Combined filters with a half-open date range [from, to) in UTC
GET {{RequestsManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests?status=Waiting&priority=High&createdFrom=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&createdTo=2025-07-01T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Free-text search (whole words in title and organization name)
GET {{RequestsManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests?search=invoice&sortBy=updatedAt&sortDirection=desc
Accept: application/json

### Sort by priority, highest first (oldest first within the same priority)
GET {{RequestsManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests?sortBy=priority&sortDirection=desc&page=2&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json

### Exact-match filters (case-sensitive)
GET {{RequestsManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests?organizationName=Acme Logistics&assignedTo=noa.cohen
Accept: application/json

### Invalid parameters -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails
GET {{RequestsManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests?pageSize=101&sortBy=title&status=Closed
Accept: application/json

### Get by id (replace with an existing id) -> 200 or 404
GET {{RequestsManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests/000000000000000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Invalid id format -> 400
GET {{RequestsManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests/not-an-id
Accept: application/json
